    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your deep familiarity with ammo types lets you push each round to its absolute limits.</p><p>Each ammo power you have active deals <strong>+1 additional damage die</strong> of its type (stacks with Ammo Master's bonus, for +2 total additional dice).</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Ammo Master. Classes: Soldier.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: the extra die is added to your ranged Strikes while an ammo effect is on you.</em></p>"
